[[2047,96,0,"<h3>Functional description</h3><p>The headlamp washer timer \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>J50</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               is\nsupplied (pin 30) by the direct line from the battery through the\nheadlamp washer fuse \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B12</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              and the maxifuse J/B2 of \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B99</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p><p>If the windscreen washer switch is operated,\nstalk switch\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>H5</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              sends two signals to the windscreen wiper\nmotor \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>N15</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              ; one of these reaches headlamp washer timer \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>J50</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               (pin\nS): it is the power source for the ignition-operated line (INT/A) of\nrelay \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>R1</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               protected by fuse \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F14</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              . \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <a href=\"#/3233972\">E3020</a>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p><p>With the side lights on, a signal reaches\npin 56 of \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>J50</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               from the steering column switch unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>H5</strong><a href=\"#/3233770\">E2010</a>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              line.</p><p>When there are both signals at pins S and\n56, the relay, inside the device \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>J50</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               which supplies the electric\nheadlamp washer pump \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>N25</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               with impulses of about half a second,\nis energized for a certain time.</p>"]]